<title>USA: Silicon Storage names Freeze COO.</title>
<headline>Silicon Storage names Freeze COO.</headline>
<dateline>SUNNYVALE, Calif. 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Silicon Storage Technology Inc Wednesday named Thomas Freeze to the post of executive vice president and chief operating officer.</p>
<p>In a statement, the company said Freeze previously served as President of Exel Microelectronics from 1994 to 1996.  </p>
<p>A spokeswoman said the position of chief operating officer is new.</p>
